    "kind": "code",
    "content": "export function sum(values) {\n  if (!Array.isArray(values) || !values.every(Number.isFinite)) {\n    throw new TypeError('Invalid input: values must be an array of finite numbers.');\n  }\n  return values.reduce((acc, val) => acc + val, 0);\n}\n",
